arly_load":false,"requires_patching":false,"api":false,"mod_id":"dominodev.smoothcaret","gd":{"win":"2.2081","android32":"2.2081","android64":"2.2081","mac-intel":"2.2081","mac-arm":"2.2081","ios":"2.2081"},"status":"accepted","created_at":"2026-05-11T01:59:37Z","updated_at":"2026-05-11T01:59:37Z"}],"tags":["offline","enhancement","interface"],"about":"# Smooth Caret\r\n\r\nYa know that little line thing that appears whenever you type in any input box?\r\nThat's called a <cy>caret</c>!\r\nIts to <cr>static</c> and moves too robotically. This mod makes it <cb>fluid</c> and <co>smooth</c> :D\r\n\r\nYou can also make it stretch for it to be even better :3\r\n\r\n**PAIR THIS MOD WITH**\\\r\n<mod:imes.smoothtextinput>\\\r\n**FOR THE MOST AMAZING TEXT INPUT EXPERIENCE YOU WILL EVER HAVE!**\r\n\r\n## Bug reports\r\nDM me on discord (<c-00ff4c>@D</c><c-19ff5e>o</c><c-32ff6f>m</c><c-4bff81>i</c><c-64ff93>n</c><c-7dffa6>o</c><c-97ffba>K</c><c-b0ffcd>i</c><c-9effb1>d</c><c-77ff7f>d</c><c-50ff4c>o</c><c-29ff1a>o</c>)\r\n\r\n## Credits\r\n\r\n<cp>Fei</c> for a full mod rewrite, and all the cool new settings :D\r\n\r\n<cy>Cheeseworks</c> for helping me fix a silly bug with geode::TextInput\r\n\r\n<cg>Imes</c> for suggesting the <cy>stretch</c> idea.\r\n","changelog":"# 1.1.1\r\n- Fix for new sillyapi\r\n\r\n\r\n# 1.1.0\r\n- more chroma options/fixes\r\n- caret blink\r\n- more stretch options\r\n- fixed geode settings menu\r\n- caret sizing options\r\n- fixed for geode::TextInput\r\n\r\n# 1.0.6\r\n- added new awesome caret colour settings :D\r\n\r\n# 1.0.5\r\n- fixed crash on startup MacOS\r\n\r\n# 1.0.4\r\n- disabled smooth caret in geode mod settings due to strange behaviour\r\n\r\n# 1.0.3\r\n- the great \"i cant count\" update\r\n\r\n# 1.0.2\r\n- the great punctuation and grammar update!\r\n\r\n# 1.0.1\r\n- made searching more robust\r\n- fixed glitch with bigger text inputs\r\n\r\n# 1.0.0\r\n- initial release\r\n\r\n","created_at":"2026-05-11T02:43:08Z","updated_at":"2026-09-05T01:06:09Z","links":{"community":null,"homepage":null,"source":"https://github.com/DominoKiddoo/smoothcaret-gdmod"}}